<title>VENEZUELA: No bids seen for Venezuela Bachaquero oil contract.</title>
<headline>No bids seen for Venezuela Bachaquero oil contract.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>No bidders came forward Friday for the contract to operate Venezuela's Bachaquero oil field in Lake Maracaibo, state oil company Petroleos de Venezuela (PDVSA) said.</p>
<p>It was the second time in the week, that has seen 19 fields come under the hammer, that an oil block has received no bids. The Cretacico Sur field, which received no bids Wednesday, is due to be re-offered Friday afternoon.</p>
</text>
